<section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY / A BIG BELIEF IN SMALL BUSINESS</p><div class="page-title-row"><h1>Our story.</h1><p>Behind every shop is someone<br>who decided to give it a go.<br>We're here for that person.</p></div></section>
<section class="story-hero"><img src="/assets/images/boutique.jpg" alt="Two women choosing knitwear together in an independent boutique" width="2200" height="1467" fetchpriority="high"><div class="wrap"><p>Not just a shop.<br><em>Someone's whole world.</em></p><span>THAT'S WHERE OUR STORY BEGINS.</span></div></section>
<section class="section wrap editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WHY</p><h2>The ambition is there.<br><em>The friction shouldn't be.</em></h2></div><div class="editorial-body"><p class="lead">Kenya doesn't have a shortage of entrepreneurial spirit. You can see it in every home studio, neighbourhood shop, market stall, and late-night product shoot.</p><p>But getting a business online can still mean stitching together a dozen different things. A social page here. A payment message there. A rider's number somewhere in your phone.</p><p>We believe selling should feel more connected than that. A good product deserves a clear path to its customer. And the person behind it deserves tools that respect their time.</p><p>That's the idea behind Shopp.ke: an online home that brings the essentials together, shaped around the way business happens here.</p></div></section>
<section class="manifesto-section section"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><h2>Small is a starting point.<br><em>Never a limitation.</em></h2><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01 /</span><h3>People before platforms.</h3><p>A business is someone's livelihood, not just another account. We approach it with the care that deserves.</p></article><article><span>02 /</span><h3>Simple is serious work.</h3><p>Good tools make the complicated parts feel clear. Every unnecessary step is time taken away from your business.</p></article><article><span>03 /</span><h3>Built around here.</h3><p>Local payments, familiar ways of selling, and the reality of getting a parcel across town. Context matters.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHERE WE'RE GOING</p><h2>Built with sellers.<br><em>Never in a vacuum.</em></h2></div><div class="editorial-body"><p class="lead">The best way to build for independent business is to listen to the people doing it.</p><p>We want to hear what makes your day easier, what gets in the way, and what your next chapter looks like. Those conversations help shape Shopp.ke.</p><p>Whether you're making your first sale or finding your next hundred customers, there should be room for you here.</p><a href="/reach-out" class="text-link">Tell us your story <?= icon('arrow-up-right') ?></a></div></section>
